{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "69db2dcade2516881a7cb4d8eacca333cee799c75a5db02a6385ef8b68e1c0e6", "ja": "だけどおもちは　美味しすぎ哉", "zh": "然而年糕啊　美味惹人怜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "36fd27d12f080adf5c5e73a5a3402489d2a0186e8f64bb3623ecd30c1556516e", "ja": "大盛況に終わった和風ユニット。レッスン中\nに行った甘味処のぜんざいが美味しかったと\nいう事で、打ち上げは劇場でおもちパーティ\nー。美咲の研究したレシピに舌鼓を打ちなが\nら、みんなは子豚ちゃんになるのだった。", "zh": "和风组合的演出盛况空前。据说因为排练时\n去过的甜品店里的红豆年糕汤非常美味，\n庆功宴便定在剧场举办年糕派对。\n品尝着美咲研究出的美味食谱，\n大家都变成了小猪仔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "383b07d1d6b7783d5b86c043fbfa503bfa5e3a69f354162d2ad6e9cfa07d7d1c", "ja": "（和風ユニットの公演は、大盛況のうちに終わった。\n打ち上げについて、みんなに希望を聞いた結果……）", "zh": "（和风组合的公演在一片盛况中落幕了。关于庆功会，问了大家的愿望，结果……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "328b49dedc48486889c6990981c159d3ca72ebf326d023dd0bda24c993f88320", "ja": "はい、いろんなおもちを用意しましたよ♪\nお腹いっぱい、食べてくださいね！", "zh": "好的，我准备了各种年糕哦♪\n请大家尽情吃，吃个饱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7323dedfc2744dde0a37201abfeb32b76e8ae1037d441ae874bba5214814b3d5", "ja": "ありがとうございます、青羽さん。けどみんな、\n本当に良かったのか？　劇場のおもちパーティーで。", "zh": "谢谢你，青羽小姐。不过大家，\n真的觉得这样就好吗？在剧场办年糕派对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "4ee1fea5ca53fb9ed359a75d9531abec7eecc11b070ee08f163402863be41746", "ja": "はい！　先日仕掛け人さまに連れて行っていただいた\n甘味処のぜんざいが、とてもおいしくて……。", "zh": "是的！前些天制作人先生带我去的甜品店，那里的红豆汤特别好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "628d49d31ac5295ad20f73056ed84879d8c7002821b3b2f7f8987153e316125f", "ja": "あの甘味処のぜんざい、絶品でした……。\n桜の塩漬けの風味が、粒あんの甘みを引き立てて……。", "zh": "那家甜品店的善哉红豆汤，真是绝品……\n盐渍樱花的风味，更衬托出了红豆粒的甜味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "c85b6b0c909f37e71c2c3f9ad5a9963e8be57e604412cda88af83ce3800218c0", "ja": "なので最初は、またあのお店に行こうかと\n話していたんですけど……。", "zh": "所以一开始还在商量，要不要再去那家店……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "51c09b617b46f2267ef7aae270082898525b82b8629f98c063f5bebafc9bd3ca", "ja": "美咲さんに、おもちのおすそ分けをいただいたので、\n劇場で食べよう、ということになりました～。", "zh": "因为美咲小姐分给了我们一些年糕，所以我们决定在剧场吃～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "30af7866ec1351cb4971b47f8fc15cfa5863e4acecc2699fb52cfd0c8fde4422", "ja": "それなら良かった。でも青羽さんには、\nかえってお手間をかける事になって、すみません。", "zh": "那就好。不过反而给青羽小姐添麻烦了，真不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "19e3fa7efabad2b2cbc433940c6a97f962e1094539860b88eb1a4c9e4deeb816", "ja": "いえいえ！　最近、おもちにはまっていて\n料理方法を研究してたので……ちょうどよかったです♪", "zh": "不不！我最近迷上了年糕，正在研究烹饪方法……正好派上用场了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "ce2a780811ad0b274b9465ef3886602167f9811c4df52f0a669c2d08e73b386c", "ja": "おかわりもたくさんありますから、\nどんどん食べてくださいね～！", "zh": "还有很多续碗，请尽管吃哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "ab07c72785673363edb170948496b5ec145a9b0999ae240d81d2f853c3a06c78", "ja": "おもちにも、いろいろな食べ方があるんですね！\n磯辺巻きにきなこに……どれもおいしそうです♪", "zh": "原来年糕也有各种各样的吃法呢！海苔卷年糕、黄豆粉年糕……每一种看起来都好好吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "c10b43f04fe8439b404e29aa115354ed7538f09fc11d6ef5752c8bf4b6416f50", "ja": "？　……このおもちは、なんでしょう？\n小判のような形で、かわいらしいですね～。", "zh": "？……这个年糕是什么呢？\n是像小判一样的形状，好可爱呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "85dbf782faed0e699578845d2e8b711e40cc36e4cb7791292ac15774bd047dff", "ja": "あ、そちらは……\n私が持参した、ころころもちです。", "zh": "啊，那个是……\n我带来的滚滚麻薯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "60e2596774d6cc4d2b3625ef83b96820a6194e462f8bb9c34cdabe2d13570116", "ja": "地元では、赤ちゃんが生まれた時に配るもので……\nとても柔らかく、そのまま食べられます。", "zh": "在老家，这是在婴儿出生时分发的东西……\n质地非常软，直接就能吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "5e3e9bef5d2e0386e10ece0217858ca31dd850d4e32b7c2402f48f975784b13c", "ja": "Wow！　紬さんの故郷のおもちが食べられるなんて、\nうれしいです♪　それではさっそく……。", "zh": "Wow！能吃到紬小姐家乡的年糕，\n我好开心♪那么我就不客气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "bd66ad64cec4b7db2abd1a2210f4cc6dd241768d6252a89e8c3d4a78102a7549", "ja": "私も、いただきまーす♪\n……うーん！　おいしい～！", "zh": "我也开动啦♪……嗯——！好好吃～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "d785f46108a8e141b635bb1564021b8d7915d185e62bec2cb309674a9f98a11e", "ja": "とっても、柔らかいおもちですね～。\n薄い塩味がついていて、おいしいですよ～。", "zh": "非常柔软的年糕呢～。\n还带着淡淡的咸味，非常好吃哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "81d725f00bca9192ccd262fd18d920aa58fc7e4825aa1a827c150a4caf8298be", "ja": "はい！　お米の甘みが感じられて……\n大変な美味でしゅ……♪", "zh": "是的！能品尝到米饭的甘甜……真是无上的美味……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7aee836cba731186e335a23d18eace2b4b6ffd70e8b869dda31b49d1dbbd47e7", "ja": "よろこんでいただけたようで、安心いたしました。\n私にとっては、これも故郷の味なので……。", "zh": "能合您的胃口，我就放心了。\n对我来说，这也是家乡的味道呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "43b5966336a381cc5638d2efc93db44d2892e6b93c16b9fbaed79e7840381b01", "ja": "さあ、遠慮せず、たくさん召し上がってください。\n{$P$}も。", "zh": "来，请别客气，多吃一些。{$P$}也请多吃点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "27e30f2ddfc8088230feb012a651b0fa8ba86b1c5783f6bb669a78b076707892", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう！　それにしても、本当にすごい量の\nおもちだな。これを全部食べたら、さすがに……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢！不过话说回来，这么多的年糕还真是惊人啊。要是把这些全吃完，未免也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "5facf7d96d6ce2df2e5541a6558c2e8d2a77b5850feceb3e51508bb0213b9f2a", "ja": "うふふ。今度こそ、私たちのほうが、\n子豚ちゃんになってしまうかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "呵呵。这次说不定就轮到我们变成小猪了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "a1323233f0caa6d929dec2306dc297480f4c0eeb5e9634213ca46a7c9331e483", "ja": "こんなにおいしいおもちが食べられるなら、\n子豚ちゃんになってもいいかも？　ぶひぶひ～♪", "zh": "要是能吃到这么美味的年糕，变成小猪猪好像也不错？哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c03d85f4cfc30c070e97ce6babb4c31a1d4106d124fd6a846645ca04905e4ce2", "ja": "えっ！？　あ、青羽さん、それは……。", "zh": "咦！？青羽小姐，那、那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "a7976c3b6955cb0b3539f063209d29ad50f2d8be7003c39e9796be8d365c555a", "ja": "エミリーちゃんも、そろそろでしょうか～？\n子豚ちゃんの魔法からは、誰も逃げられませんよ～♪", "zh": "艾米莉差不多也该到了吧～？\n谁都逃不出小猪崽的魔法哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "a09534a389d179fc63fa9f98579252c9671d18e0e1f96acb3a06ca6f08e34953", "ja": "えっ？　え、ええと……！\nぶ、ぶひぶひ～！", "zh": "诶？呃、那个……！\n哼、哼哼～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fa52aab1b4bdc40af1149e0dba90d0f88b9e4426ca77b79993e75bbd4ee2ed07", "ja": "ええっ、そんな……！\nちょっと待ってください、おふたりとも！", "zh": "诶诶，怎么会这样……！\n两位，请稍等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "f6f4411eb2b4f93ddc024369b8a945ddc4cedab507f860b78cd9347b44297b42", "ja": "もちろん{$P$}さんもですよ～？\n紬さんに、お手本を見せてくださいね～。", "zh": "当然也包括{$P$}先生哦～？\n要给紬小姐好好做个示范呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "972dab3479cfff742c94fd777af990876c8dae52e2a5e6f93abcf00abc2b2500", "ja": "そう来ると思ったよ……ぶひぶひ。", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说……哼哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5188e7b38162a8637c280977c9dbb18c5350a3b586e157a679829cd9ef941107", "ja": "{$P$}！\nあ、あなたまでそんな……！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n连、连您也这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "5964523f62760f8ce3201c9f283b17c8c2e129484ab6004a60fa77c9904adadb", "ja": "ぶひぶひ！", "zh": "哼哧哼哧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_07_1031_102mis", "source_sha256": "5964523f62760f8ce3201c9f283b17c8c2e129484ab6004a60fa77c9904adadb", "ja": "ぶひぶひ！", "zh": "哼哧哼哧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
